# Release builds: track the Cicero UI build and Atticus server builds that should be synced.
# Other release build folders, temporary timestamp builds, logs, and backups stay ignored.
ReleaseBuilds/*
!ReleaseBuilds/.gitignore
!ReleaseBuilds/Cicero/
!ReleaseBuilds/Cicero/**
!ReleaseBuilds/Atticus/
!ReleaseBuilds/Atticus/x86/
!ReleaseBuilds/Atticus/x86/**
!ReleaseBuilds/Atticus/x64/
!ReleaseBuilds/Atticus/x64/**
ReleaseBuilds/Cicero/backup/
ReleaseBuilds/Cicero/RunLogs/
